:30.2,"text":"« Moi ? rit Lumi. Je suis un tout petit caillou de l’espace. Quand je file à travers l’air, je deviens toute chaude et je brille. » Sacha et Lumi montèrent encore plus haut. Voici la lune, ronde et grise, pleine de petits creux. « Pourquoi la lune change de forme ? » demanda Sacha. « Elle ne change pas, dit Lumi. Le soleil éclaire juste un morceau différent selon les soirs. »","words":[0.12,0.12,1.07,1.07,1.39,2.42,2.695,2.92,3.095,3.32,3.72,3.995,4.07,5.47,5.745,5.995,6.245,6.345,6.895,7.745,7.895,8.395,8.745,9.02,9.12,9.345,10.51,10.51,11.15,11.25,11.6,12.075,12.5,12.825,13.7,14.205,14.38,15.08,15.38,15.505,16.155,16.48,16.605,17.03,17.98,17.98,18.43,18.58,18.93,19.23,19.43,20.49,20.49,20.49,21.065,22.19,22.19,22.465,22.665,23.065,23.72,24.04,25.22,25.55,26.3,27.025,27.475,27.575,28.075,28.65,28.95,29.175,29.175],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.315,"small"],[0.365,"smile"],[0.49,"open"],[0.755,"smile"],[1.19,"grin"],[1.465,"o"],[1.565,"small"],[1.64,"smile"],[1.715,"grin"],[1.905,"smile"],[2.545,"grin"],[2.945,"o"],[3.12,"grin"],[3.195,"o"],[3.345,"grin"],[3.82,"open"],[3.895,"grin"],[4.345,"small"],[4.42,"smile"],[4.545,"open"],[4.695,"grin"],[4.955,"smile"],[5.52,"grin"],[5.595,"open"],[5.77,"grin"],[6.02,"small"],[6.12,"grin"],[6.27,"open"],[6.37,"grin"],[6.52,"open"],[6.595,"small"],[6.67,"smile"],[6.745,"grin"],[6.995,"smile"],[7.145,"grin"],[7.595,"smile"],[7.77,"grin"],[8.095,"small"],[8.17,"grin"],[8.495,"o"],[8.595,"grin"],[8.87,"o"],[8.945,"grin"],[9.37,"small"],[9.445,"grin"],[9.52,"smile"],[9.62,"grin"],[9.995,"smile"],[10.65,"grin"],[10.75,"open"],[10.875,"grin"],[10.975,"smile"],[11.05,"open"],[11.175,"grin"],[11.325,"o"],[11.425,"small"],[11.525,"grin"],[11.675,"o"],[11.725,"smile"],[11.8,"grin"],[12.15,"smile"],[12.225,"grin"],[12.325,"o"],[12.4,"grin"],[12.525,"small"],[12.6,"grin"],[12.675,"o"],[12.85,"smile"],[12.925,"o"],[13.185,"smile"],[13.83,"small"],[13.905,"o"],[13.98,"open"],[14.055,"grin"],[14.305,"open"],[14.455,"smile"],[14.5